docling-layout-heron-coreml is a Core ML format conversion of
docling-project/docling-layout-heron:

https://huggingface.co/docling-project/docling-layout-heron

The model weights were not retrained or fine-tuned. The upstream model is
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The conversion scripts and accompanying
documentation in this repository are also provided under Apache-2.0.

Docling and the original model are works of their respective contributors.
